# Gemma 4 via Google AI Studio (Gemini API)
# 1. Get your API key at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
# 2. Create a .env.local file (git-ignored) with the values below
# 3. Leave GEMINI_API_KEY unset to run KIBO fully on simulated responses (no key needed)
#
# The model name defaults to "gemma-4" — change GEMINI_MODEL if you need
# a different variant (e.g. "gemma-4-preview", "gemma-4-flash", etc.)

# GEMINI_API_KEY=your-api-key-here
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemma-4